WEBVTT

00:16:28.316 --> 00:16:30.116
how much they do indeed diverge.

00:16:30.116 --> 00:16:32.836
You will probably remember
this famous dress,

00:16:32.876 --> 00:16:36.556
this photo of a dress
half the world saw as blue and black,

00:16:36.556 --> 00:16:39.196
and the other half saw as white and gold.

00:16:39.196 --> 00:16:43.876
AS: You're a white and gold person?
DB: Yeah, yeah.

00:16:43.876 --> 00:16:45.476
AS: I'm a blue and black person.

00:16:45.516 --> 00:16:48.156
I was right, the real dress
is actually blue and black.

00:16:48.156 --> 00:16:49.356
(Laughter)

00:16:49.356 --> 00:16:51.156
AS: Never mind ...

00:16:51.676 --> 00:16:53.916
DB: We could argue about that.

00:16:53.956 --> 00:16:56.196
AS: We couldn't.
It really is blue and black.

00:16:56.196 --> 00:16:59.516
I talked to the dress designer.
The actual one is blue and black.

00:16:59.516 --> 00:17:01.436
There's no argument there.